warning[neg_multiply]: `x * -1` is a negation
  --> tests/lint/neg_multiply/example.jai:4:12
   |
 4 |     return x * -1;
   |            ^^^^^^
   |
help: write `-x`
   |
 3   flip :: (x: int) -> int {
 4 ~     return -x;
 5   }
   |
   = note: `neg_multiply` is `warn` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/neg_multiply
